## 4. Gestión de Ambientes y Despliegue

- **Local Dev:** `npm start` (apunta a `environment.development.ts`, `useMocks: false`, API: `https://localhost:7298/api`).
- **Local Mock:** `npm run start:mock` (apunta a `environment.mock.ts`, `useMocks: true`).
- **Vercel / Nube:** `npm run build` (apunta a `environment.prod.ts`, `useMocks: true` de forma transitoria hasta desplegar el backend).

